function auditHtml82(){return `<p>Version 82 · Desktop payroll and operational reports. No saved PIT or SSO values were replaced.</p><p>Reference PDFs were used for layout and workflow only. The Ryan PDF category summary omits a 5,000 transport item; this implementation derives category totals and details from the same source records. The shift PDF mixes month labels; report headings use the selected dates. Sample employee or payroll figures have not been imported.</p>`+table82(['Area','Settings','Integration','Behavior / remaining work'],audit82.map(r=>r.map(esc82)))+`<p>Database setup is required to save employees, leave, payroll runs and report snapshots. The setup adds four named tables with admin-only access, revision checks and immutable finalized payroll. It does not alter your existing transactions or settings. It has not been run by this update.</p><p>Pure ledger reports are calculated from transactions. Manual leave, attendance, explanations, POS totals and financing requests need saved records; they cannot reliably be reconstructed from journal entries alone.</p>`}
